step Get 60 Linen Cloth
  tip For 30 Bolts of Linen Cloth.
  collect 2589 x60 nearest gather levels 5-20
  auction 2589 x60

step Craft 30 Bolts of Linen Cloth until 30
  tip About 30 crafts. Keep all 30 bolts: the belts next use them.
  craft 2963 until 30

